Decided: the closed-issue sweep asks GitHub issueOrPullRequest with __typename, and a PR number leaves as closed-other once
Because: crates/core/src/gh.rs:314
Because: "Drive never starts or restarts a lane for a number that is a PR, or for an issue that is closed"
